- AI-powered resume ranking using GPT-4o
- Structured job description analysis
- Candidate skill gap detection
- Interview question generation
- Credit-based usage with flexible plans

## Usage

${siteTitle} is a SaaS platform for HR teams and hiring managers. Users paste a job description, upload candidate resumes, and receive ranked results with scores, skill matches, and interview questions within seconds.

