                  placeholder="Rankora is an AI-powered resume screening SaaS platform designed for HR teams and hiring managers. Users paste a job description, upload candidate resumes, and receive GPT-4o-scored rankings with skill gap analysis and interview question suggestions within seconds..."
                  className="min-h-[120px]"
